Wenfang · 文房六色
==================

Color inspiration
-----------------
The six palettes were inspired by the publicly published color values of
Inkstone · 墨观 (https://inkstone.konata9.cc/zh/), then mapped onto the Codex
`codex-theme-v1:…` appearance format and the DeepSeek Harness `--dsw-*` token
model.

- Wenfang is an independent series name and brand.
- This repository is not an official theme pack of Inkstone / 墨观.
- Only color values were referenced; no code, assets, or brand material from
  that site is redistributed here.

Third-party platforms
---------------------
"Codex" and "ChatGPT" are products of OpenAI. "DeepSeek Harness" is a project of
DeepSeek AI. Product names are used only to describe compatibility.
